      "writtenOn": "2023-02-24T01:27:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree. This file a copying all of the KVM ioctls and creating the UAPI which doesn\u0027t serve the purpose if the commit is explaining that we are using the kvm ioctls. Why not just invoke open(\"/dev/kvm\",...) directly from the CrosVM when running MTK Hypervisor?\n\nThis approach looks wrong to me atleast at high level.",
